<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan banks and markets closed Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan banks and markets closed Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets will close Wednesday, January 1 for the New Year's Day holiday.</p>
<p>Markets and banks will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
